Id: dbs001f
Severity: FAIL
Category: services
Check: check_databases
Fix: Remove skip-grant-tables and restart the server.
References: mysqld(8)
Controls: CIS 5.2; NIST IA-2, IA-5(1); ISO 5.17, 8.5; CE User access control

MySQL or MariaDB runs with skip-grant-tables: authentication is off
and anyone connecting has every privilege without a password. It is a
recovery switch for a lost root password, never a running
configuration.
